# Photo LUT Extractor

Browser application that extracts a global RGB color transformation from an
original/edited image pair and exports a truecolour RGB PNG compatible with
Hald CLUT Level 8.

All image processing is performed locally in the browser. Images are not
uploaded anywhere.

## Output format

- PNG truecolour RGB, PNG colour type 2
- 512 × 512 pixels
- Hald CLUT Level 8
- 64 × 64 × 64 RGB entries
- Pixel order and geometry inherited directly from `neutral_LUT.png`

The application does not construct an alternative LUT layout. It transforms
the RGB values of the supplied neutral Hald image while preserving its exact
dimensions and pixel positions.
